    rdf:value """Tuesday, August 29, I Tatti
Hot!
B.B. fit to be in bed. He feels horribly seasick. It is 84° and very trying. B.B. went up to Monte Senario, but it did him no good. I went to see Aunt Janet who talked a lot about Hutton and Yoï. She has it greatly on her mind. I tried to make her think there was nothing in it. """^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 206 ;
